PASS   4  every Tool has closed policy metadata and a live declared error vocabulary
          - 33 error codes; zero unknown or dead; 31 closed policy objects
PASS   5  helper and broker operations are closed, caller-bound and never return plaintext
          - 25 helper and 22 broker operations, exact and caller-bound
PASS   6  xui_install is clean-host-only, fixed-adapter, secretless and owned-invertible
          - clean host only; pinned adapter; no caller command/path/URL or plaintext secret; owned inverse required
PASS   7  Cloudflare, certificate, Nginx and client profile bind one exact node hostname
